n></div></div></div><div data-rid="3f040975-1ad1-49f6-bf1d-08da68d93a17" style="--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-dda96745-05c6-4f0b-bea1-e4c757c127fb-attributes-color:#151515" class="r-1gdxfzo"><div data-rid="0ddda69f-c8fe-4241-9036-9f31e66c9b52" class="r-wd7rra alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Creative Direction + UX</p></span></div><div data-rid="76e27ffe-b3de-4b19-8d07-cecaf0ef288d" class="r-1paysej alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>On the next call, we present 3 art direction options and map out UX for all core pages to establish both your brand story and product story. Each gets 1 refinement pass after review.</p></span></div><div data-rid="c9596e9d-d90c-433f-ad23-94e5d5df9ad5" class="r-8zyusw"><div data-rid="51e625f3-12e4-45d5-8af8-346d1a6fc561" class="r-kyknsq alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>3</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="036594bb-c172-4878-9dd5-0a0664f645c3" class="r-1wj3y0q"><div data-rid="a194f0c3-5273-419e-a390-fca403082599" class="r-18hrsre alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Key Page Design & Build</p></span></div><div data-rid="ab5cd542-702c-424c-8597-db224914a132" class="r-yhbnui alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>We design the Home Page and Product Page and any additional pages in Figma, refine them once more, and then implement them directly in your theme.</p></span></div><div data-rid="c7afe61c-d7fa-4431-85ac-443cc5bc9c79" class="r-ao9rt8"><div data-rid="2a8c244c-bc42-4b43-b496-67b63e6ddb95" class="r-9t0u5i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>4</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="b2d15179-e78d-425a-ae3d-b836c662e37a" class="r-d23169"><div data-rid="2f809138-c3f8-4895-ab7d-73607a557c31" class="r-zfscrh alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Launch With Confidence</p></span></div><div data-rid="261017cc-7e7a-4663-ab73-917ab0bf0760" class="r-1trujtd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The result: a Shopify site customers will trust, with a clear brand and product story that removes friction, overcomes objections, and drives conversions.</p></span></div><div data-rid="3484e3c4-eeda-4d75-a89e-ad74149749ef" class="r-1xtpq7u"><div data-rid="d9aa0f2f-5518-4e08-9b17-76695ba8336f" class="r-1phyjim alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>5</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f829378a-d9c6-4ed7-a85b-cbfb63bc512b" class="r-1eltov9"><div data-rid="e3a75335-4892-47b3-a4b2-a051f2ea0cd8" class="r-pxkgvw alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-63d26550-4d80-449d-a2dd-dbd8aab04e86-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-266e213d-0310-416b-aeb9-992e93f86dd3-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Don't Let Your Advertising Go To Waste</p></span></div><div data-rid="79ca0136-672e-4b5c-b09f-6693bd783662" class="r-7lfjbz alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-8b456d31-9c45-4f18-a8ee-a92afd5fd3a9-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>What's the point of creating all that content or spending all those ad dollars just for it to fall flat with a poor website?  Change your trajectory today.</p></span></div><button data-rid="0e14dfa0-f621-4cb2-8cfd-d4719037ee1a" class="text r-jl1tlp alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="97395bfe-b1b4-49e9-8c67-abfc2d06d9f8" class="r-1g3kj16 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-8b456d31-9c45-4f18-a8ee-a92afd5fd3a9-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Get Started</p></span></div></button></div><div data-rid="1035daf5-b844-4ef6-a7bd-e1e71dc3e4e3" class="r-1fbhpu5"><div data-rid="a1247061-2ead-4172-898c-7f35a9f92f95" class="r-gkoki4"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="vertical" style="display:contents"><div data-rid="68864d27-97ce-4c91-9944-9f47d7cdce38" class="r-1h3pi27"><div data-rid="aab689b1-558c-4c2f-b14a-9215c00a1cd0" class="r-1npwbo alchem