e="--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-5f79ca3b-d3e9-4364-bad0-f6af4089bf85-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-63d26550-4d80-449d-a2dd-dbd8aab04e86-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>About Us</p></span></div><div data-rid="e6f9ab2e-82d7-4794-a97e-cadddb5091a4" class="r-1hjezzg alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-bbf7dacd-140d-4e82-bae9-7b6fcb92e864-styles-8b456d31-9c45-4f18-a8ee-a92afd5fd3a9-attributes-textdecoration:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>We’ve been building on Shopify since 2011, making us one of the platform’s earliest agency partners. Today, as a designated <strong>Shopify Plus Partner</strong>, we work with some of the biggest brands in e-commerce - bringing the same level of expertise to growth-minded businesses ready to scale.</p><br><p>Conspire was founded by <strong>Daniel James Andrade</strong>, who built a multimillion-dollar clothing company on Shopify before launching the agency. That first-hand entrepreneurial experience shapes how we work: always focused on real outcomes, not just deliverables.</p><br><p>Beyond client work, we’ve also developed multiple Shopify apps used by hundreds of merchants. And because we stay close to the latest tools and strategies, we’re able to guide our clients with proven protocols that drive revenue through better on-site branding, strategy, and customer experience.</p></span></div></div><picture data-rid="e7ae6326-3f06-4dbe-b775-82a46ebbe096" class="r-bxs6pz"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/9347/2437/files/Screenshot2025-05-15at1.14.57PM.png?v=1747341573&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/9347/2437/files/Screenshot2025-05-15at1.14.57PM.png?v=1747341573&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/9347/2437/files/Screenshot2025-05-15at1.14.57PM.png?v=1747341573&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/9347/2437/files/Screenshot2025-05-15at1.14.57PM.png?v=1747341573" class="r-h7ek9d" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div></div><style>@import url(https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600;700;800;900;950)</style></div>
